cs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","jsx-a11y/img-redundant-alt","Redundant alt attribute. Screen-readers already announce `img` tags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","no-global-assign","no-unsafe-negation"]